{"4610870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NightFang", "steam_appid": 4610870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4807100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary</strong><br>Nightfang wears its inspirations on it's sleeve. <br>It's an 80s/90s Anime/VHS inspired Shmup, rendered in delicious <br>3D that hypnotizes you into thinking it's 2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a third generation cadet in the ongoing conflict,<br>fight your way through the hordes of enemy fighters,<br>as bullets are unleashed all around you.<br><br>Recruit other fighter pilots to join your cause.<br>Become a leader, build a team.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics rendered as 3d pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade style vertical auto-scroller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruitable fighters pilot who will man a ship and provide support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story inspired by 80s anime</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary and alternative firing modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Youth</i> is a <i>falling star</i>. Let it burn through the <i>Crimson Scourge</i>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary</strong><br>Nightfang wears its inspirations on it's sleeve. <br>It's an 80s/90s Anime/VHS inspired Shmup, rendered in delicious <br>3D that hypnotizes you into thinking it's 2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a third generation cadet in the ongoing conflict,<br>fight your way through the hordes of enemy fighters,<br>as bullets are unleashed all around you.<br><br>Recruit other fighter pilots to join your cause.<br>Become a leader, build a team.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics rendered as 3d pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade style vertical auto